---
description: Decide whether two facts say the same thing, contradict each other, or are about different things.
readout: decision
args:
  first: string
  second: string
returns: Relation
---
Compare first and second:
1. same: they state the same fact, even in different words.
2. conflict: they are about the same thing but give different values or opposite decisions.
3. unrelated: they are about different things.
